    title: 'ML Feature Store',
    icon: '🧠',
    description: 'Design a Feast/Tecton-style feature store that serves consistent features for offline training and low-latency online inference across hundreds of models.',
    systemContext: 'You are the ML platform architect at a marketplace company with 300 production models owned by 40 teams. Training-serving skew, leaked labels, and stale features cause repeated revenue-impacting model regressions, and online inference demands single-digit-millisecond feature reads.',
    initialRequirement: 'Design the MVP feature store: a feature registry, an offline store for training data, an online store for serving, ingestion pipelines, and a serving API.',
